# Site settings for the live GPU deployment. Copy this file to site.env (git-ignored) next to it, or
# point LR_SITE_ENV at a copy elsewhere. Variables already set in the environment win over this file.
# stage_source.sh writes the node-side subset (LR_NODE_SITE_KEYS in common.sh) next to the staged
# deploy scripts on the cluster. Every value below is a placeholder.

# --- workstation side --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Campaign root (CR); live job records go to CR/facts/live.json.
LR_CR=/path/to/learned-routing-campaign
# ssh alias (from ~/.ssh/config) of the GPU cluster's Slurm login node.
LR_SSH_ALIAS=my-gpu-cluster
# Slurm account and the default partition for submit.sh.
LR_ACCOUNT=my-slurm-account
LR_PARTITION=my-gpu-partition
# Label recorded with each job in live.json (optional, default "gpu").
# LR_CLUSTER=gpu
# Cooperative hold-lock directory (optional, default ~/.lr-gpu-hold).
# LR_HOLD_LOCK_DIR=$HOME/.lr-gpu-hold
# A clone of this repository on the cluster's shared filesystem that already contains
# LR_BUNDLE_BASE (default 373bc9f92944507f8a82dd602dc391c0f83d61f1); stage_source.sh clones from it.
LR_BASE_REPO=/shared/fs/path/to/dynamo-clone

# --- cluster side (shared filesystem paths, as seen from the login and compute nodes) -----------
# Root mounted into the containers; must contain everything below.
LR_SHARED_ROOT=/shared/fs/path/to/project
# Durable root of the live lane: bundles, sources, wheels, venvs, plans, jobs, runs, caches.
LR_LIVE_ROOT=/shared/fs/path/to/project/learned-routing/live
# Either a runtime directory with images/vllm-v0.24.0.sqsh and models/Qwen3-32B ...
LR_PRIOR_RUNTIME=/shared/fs/path/to/project/runtime
# ... or the two inputs directly:
# LR_IMAGE_SQSH=/shared/fs/path/to/vllm-v0.24.0.sqsh
# LR_MODEL_MASTER=/shared/fs/path/to/Qwen3-32B
# Shell file that puts rustc, protoc and uv on PATH for the wheel build (default
# $LR_SHARED_ROOT/toolchains/env.sh).
# LR_TOOLCHAIN_ENV=/shared/fs/path/to/toolchains/env.sh
# Node-local scratch base (default /raid/scratch, local NVMe on DGX H100 nodes) and an optional
# prefix for the per-job directory name.
# LR_NODE_BASE=/raid/scratch
# LR_NODE_TAG=myname
